--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IN THE DIRECTORY, NOT IN THE HOUSE FORM  --  56 pages
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored tools, hubs, and earlier-form works that live alongside the spheres.
They carry none of the five-window shell, so the sphere score does not apply to them.
